sequenceDiagram
	participant Commerce as Commerce MFE
	participant Ordering as Ordering API
	participant Basket as Basket API
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant Finance as Finance (Durable Task)

	Commerce ->> Ordering: HTTPS POST /ordering/api/v1/orders (idempotency key)
	Ordering ->> Basket: gRPC basket.v1.GetBasket
	Ordering ->> Catalog: gRPC book.v1.GetBooks (resolve sale/regular prices)
	Ordering -->> Commerce: 201 Created (orderId, status: New)
	Ordering ->> Finance: Kafka UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent
	Finance ->> Basket: Kafka PlaceOrderCommand (delete basket, bounded retries)

	alt Basket deleted
		Basket ->> Finance: Kafka BasketDeletedCompleteIntegrationEvent
		Finance ->> Ordering: Kafka DeleteBasketCompleteCommand (logged, status stays New)
	else Basket deletion failed
		Basket ->> Finance: Kafka BasketDeletedFailedIntegrationEvent
		Finance ->> Ordering: Kafka DeleteBasketFailedCommand (soft-deletes Order, no email)
	end
